<title>INDIA: India Ambuja half year results on Feb 5.</title>
<headline>India Ambuja half year results on Feb 5.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian cement firm Gujarat Ambuja Cements Ltd on Wednesday said it would convene a meeting of its board of directors on February 5 to finalise financial results for the six months ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>It will also consider declaration of an interim dividend, the company said in a statement. The company paid a 50 percent dividend in 1995/96 (July-June), it added.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
